### Single-agent: weather
GET http://localhost:8080/ask?q=What+is+the+weather+in+New+York?&session=s1

###

### Single-agent: math
GET http://localhost:8080/ask?q=What+is+25*4?&session=s1

###

### Single-agent: cricket
GET http://localhost:8080/ask?q=What+is+the+CSK+score?&session=s1

###

### Multi-agent: single domain (routes to weather_agent)
GET http://localhost:8080/multi-agent?q=What+is+the+weather+in+New+York+in+Fahrenheit?

###

### Multi-agent: compound question (routes to weather_agent + math_agent simultaneously)
GET http://localhost:8080/multi-agent?q=What+is+the+weather+in+New+York+and+what+is+125*8?

###

### Multi-agent: all three domains
GET http://localhost:8080/multi-agent?q=What+is+the+CSK+score,+the+weather+in+New+York,+and+what+is+100/4?

###